{"seq":2,"slug":"training-stability","title":"训练稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-experts/training/training-stability","wordCount":1482,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"训练稳定性\">训练稳定性</h1><p>MoE 模型在训练时比同规模稠密模型更容易「炸」：loss 突然飙升、出现 NaN、或在低精度下悄悄退化。根源在于路由器——它是一个对输入极其敏感的离散决策器，其 logits 的量级会在训练中无约束地膨胀，把 softmax 推向饱和、把梯度推向爆炸或消失。负载均衡（见 <a href=\"load-balancing\">负载均衡与辅助损失</a>）解决的是「token 分得均不均」，而稳定性解决的是「数值会不会崩」——两者常被混淆，但治理手段不同。本篇聚焦让 MoE 训练全程不崩的那组技术：router z-loss、精度选择、专家初始化与 dropout 顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>不稳定的核心来自路由 logits 的量级失控。门控对每个专家算分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i = (W_g x)_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再过 softmax。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的绝对值越来越大，softmax 输出趋于 one-hot，对输入的微小扰动变得极度敏感，反向传播的梯度也随之剧烈震荡。在 bf16 这类低精度下，大 logit 经 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span></span></span></span></span> 后极易溢出成 inf，进而 NaN。下表列出主要不稳定来源与对策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>不稳定来源</th>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路由 logit 膨胀</td>\n<td>softmax 饱和、梯度爆炸、NaN</td>\n<td>router z-loss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低精度路由计算</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span></span></span></span></span> 溢出</td>\n<td>路由部分用 fp32</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专家梯度尖峰</td>\n<td>loss spike</td>\n<td>梯度裁剪、专家初始缩放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由突变</td>\n<td>训练后期 token 大规模换专家</td>\n<td>偏置/温度退火</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  X[token x] --&gt; H[路由 logits h = Wg·x]&#10;  H --&gt; Z[z-loss 惩罚 log-sum-exp 量级]&#10;  H --&gt; F[fp32 计算 softmax]&#10;  F --&gt; SM[门控权重]&#10;  Z --&gt; Add[加入总损失抑制膨胀]&#10;  SM --&gt; EXP[专家前向]&#10;  EXP --&gt; GC[梯度裁剪 + 专家初始缩放]\">flowchart TD\n  X[token x] --&gt; H[路由 logits h = Wg·x]\n  H --&gt; Z[z-loss 惩罚 log-sum-exp 量级]\n  H --&gt; F[fp32 计算 softmax]\n  F --&gt; SM[门控权重]\n  Z --&gt; Add[加入总损失抑制膨胀]\n  SM --&gt; EXP[专家前向]\n  EXP --&gt; GC[梯度裁剪 + 专家初始缩放]</pre><h2 id=\"router-z-loss-按住-logit-量级\">Router z-loss：按住 logit 量级</h2><p>router z-loss 是稳定 MoE 训练最关键的单项技术，已被 Switch、Mixtral、DeepSeek 及 Megatron-LM/DeepSpeed-MoE 几乎所有大规模训练框架采纳。它直接惩罚路由 logits 的对数配分函数（log-sum-exp）量级：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>T</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_z = \\beta \\cdot \\frac{1}{T} \\sum_{t=1}^{T} \\Big( \\log \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\exp(h_i^{(t)}) \\Big)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.354em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：log-sum-exp 近似于最大 logit，把它的平方拉小，就等于不鼓励任何 logit 变得过大，从而让 softmax 保持在数值安全、梯度平滑的区间。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级。z-loss 与负载均衡辅助损失正交：前者管 logit 的<strong>绝对量级</strong>（数值安全），后者管 logit 的<strong>相对分布</strong>（均衡），实践中两者通常同时启用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精度策略-路由部分必须高精\">精度策略：路由部分必须高精</h2><p>即便有了 z-loss，低精度仍是隐患。业界共识是：<strong>专家的矩阵乘可以用 bf16/fp8，但路由器的打分与 softmax 应在 fp32 下计算</strong>。原因是路由是一个「赢家通吃」的决策点，bf16 的有限尾数会让接近的 logits 因舍入而错判 top-k，造成 token 在专家间无意义地抖动，破坏分化的连续性。</p>\n<p>2025 年随 fp8 训练普及（DeepSeek-V3 大量使用 fp8 GEMM），这一原则更显重要：DeepSeek 报告对路由及若干敏感算子保留高精度累加，才在 fp8 主干上稳住了训练。换言之，稀疏带来的额外数值敏感点，要靠「在路由处局部提精度」来对冲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"初始化-dropout-与路由退火\">初始化、dropout 与路由退火</h2><p>还有几个常被忽略却很影响稳定的细节。其一是<strong>专家初始化缩放</strong>：因为 top-k 聚合会把多个专家输出相加，若各专家按稠密 FFN 的标准方差初始化，合并后的激活方差偏大，易触发早期 loss spike，故常对专家输出投影做缩小初始化。其二是<strong>dropout 的放置</strong>：在 MoE 层里，专家内 dropout 与路由后的处理顺序若搞反，会引入训练—推理不一致。</p>\n<p>其三是<strong>路由的平滑过渡</strong>。Noisy top-k 的噪声、Expert-Choice 的容量、以及 DeepSeek 偏置法的偏置项，都应在训练中平滑退火，避免后期路由「硬切换」——大量 token 在某一步突然集体改投专家，会造成专家输入分布骤变、loss 跳变。把这些超参数做成随训练进度缓变的调度，是大规模 MoE 平稳收敛的隐性功课。这些机制与 <a href=\"../foundations/routing-gating\">路由与门控</a> 的范式选择一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"诊断一次-loss-spike-从现象到根因\">诊断一次 loss spike：从现象到根因</h2><p>实战中遇到 MoE 训练 loss 突然飙升，排查有一套大致顺序。先看是否真崩还是抖动：若 loss 飙升后几十步内自行回落，多半是某个 batch 的路由瞬时极端失衡，可容忍或调容量因子；若一路飙到 NaN 不回头，则是数值崩溃，要往下查。</p>\n<p>下一步看梯度范数曲线。若崩溃前梯度范数先出现尖峰，配合路由 logit 量级（可监控 z-loss 项数值）同步上涨，基本可锁定是 logit 膨胀导致 softmax 饱和——对策是调大 z-loss 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 或收紧梯度裁剪阈值。若梯度正常但激活里出现 inf，则更可能是低精度下专家 GEMM 或路由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span></span></span></span></span> 溢出——对策是把路由计算提到 fp32、检查 fp8 scale 是否失配。还有一类隐蔽情况：loss 不崩但下游质量缓慢退化，往往是路由「软坍缩」——表面均衡（辅助损失满足）但实际分化在恶化，这要回到 <a href=\"load-balancing\">负载均衡与辅助损失</a> 与 <a href=\"expert-specialization\">专家专业化</a> 联合排查。把「现象→可疑指标→对策」做成检查表，是大规模 MoE 训练的必备运维资产。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MoE 不稳定的根源是路由 logits 量级无约束膨胀，导致 softmax 饱和、梯度爆炸、低精度下 NaN。</li>\n<li>router z-loss 通过惩罚 log-sum-exp 平方按住 logit 量级，是大规模 MoE 训练的标配，与负载均衡损失正交。</li>\n<li>精度策略的铁律：专家可低精，路由打分与 softmax 应 fp32；fp8 训练时代尤其关键。</li>\n<li>专家输出缩小初始化、正确的 dropout 放置、路由超参的平滑退火，共同消除 loss spike 与训练—推理不一致。</li>\n<li>稳定性管「数值不崩」，均衡管「分配不偏」，分化管「学到不同」——三者分工明确又彼此影响。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://mbrenndoerfer.com/writing/router-z-loss-moe-training-stability\">Router Z-Loss for MoE Training Stability (Brenndoerfer)</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.19437\">DeepSeek-V3 Technical Report (arXiv:2412.19437)</a>、<a href=\"https://docs.nvidia.com/megatron-core/developer-guide/0.15.0/api-guide/moe.html\">Megatron-Core MoE 文档</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"训练稳定性","id":"训练稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Router z-loss：按住 logit 量级","id":"router-z-loss-按住-logit-量级"},{"level":2,"text":"精度策略：路由部分必须高精","id":"精度策略-路由部分必须高精"},{"level":2,"text":"初始化、dropout 与路由退火","id":"初始化-dropout-与路由退火"},{"level":2,"text":"诊断一次 loss spike：从现象到根因","id":"诊断一次-loss-spike-从现象到根因"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"负载均衡与辅助损失","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-experts/training/load-balancing"},"next":{"title":"专家专业化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-experts/training/expert-specialization"}}